  "description": "The Genesis CDA 10 is where gravel freedom begins. Designed as the entry point into the CDA family, it delivers the perfect balance of comfort, practicality and fun ‐ lightweight, reliable, and built for real-world riding. Whether it's a weekday commute, an evening spin through the park, or a weekend adventure along gravel tracks, the CDA 10 is always ready to roll.\n\nThe CDA 10's 6061 aluminium frame keeps things light and lively, while a chromoly fork adds a smooth, composed feel when the surface turns rough. Disc brakes ensure confident stopping in any weather, and the geometry has been shaped for stable, predictable handling on road and trail alike.\n\nWith clearance for 45mm tyres and mounts for racks, mudguards and extra bottles, the CDA 10 is a bike you can easily make your own. Dependable components and strong Amplitude wheels mean minimal maintenance and maximum riding time.\n\nPractical, comfortable and endlessly versatile, the CDA 10 offers outstanding value for riders taking their first step into the world of gravel ‐ or anyone who simply wants a capable bike that can do it all.",
